<title>USA: Independent Bank Q3 shr rises to $0.20.</title>
<headline>Independent Bank Q3 shr rises to $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKLAND, Mass. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.20		    $0.18</p>
<p> Net			  3,024		    2,673</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,563		   14,482</p>
<p>		Nine months ended Sept. 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			  8,356		    7,685</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,544		   14,467</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nonperforming loans as of Sept. 30 totaled $6.4 million or .60 percent of total assets, an 8 percent drop from a year earlier. Loan loss reserves was $12 million, or 1.8 percent of gross loans and 198.68 percent of nonperforming loans.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
